msgid "Ledger drone inbound, %s! It's heading for a clean hex."
msgstr "Ledger 无人机来袭，%s！它正飞向一片干净的六角格。"

#: story/ledger.gd:498
msgid "A Ledger drone is coming to dump junk on a clean hex (%s of you). It can't touch planted ground."
msgstr "一架 Ledger 无人机要往干净的六角格上倾倒废料（在你的%s）。它碰不了种了植物的地面。"

#: story/ledger.gd:535
msgid "SIGNAL JAMMED"
msgstr "信号已干扰"

#: story/ledger.gd:565
msgid "Target re-classified as ASSET. Aborting. ...Interesting."
msgstr "目标重新归类为资产。中止。……有意思。"

#: story/ledger.gd:636
msgid "The drone dumped a little junk back. Scoop it up, or let your helpers tidy it. A Signal Jammer at the base keeps drones away."
msgstr "无人机倒回了一点废料。把它铲起来，或者让你的帮手收拾。基地里的信号干扰器能赶走无人机。"

#: story/ledger.gd:692
msgid "SEEDS · PAID IN FULL"
msgstr "种子 · 已全额支付"

#: story/ledger.gd:709 systems/events.gd:500 systems/lumi_level.gd:218
msgid "+%d seeds"
msgstr "+%d 种子"

#: story/ledger.gd:781
msgid "E   jack in: rewrite the Ledger's contract"
msgstr "E   接入：改写 Ledger 的合同"

#: story/ledger.gd:781
msgid "E   read the amended contract"
msgstr "E   阅读修订后的合同"

